gned}p & =\\pm \\sqrt{-\\frac{9}{25}} \\\\  & =\\pm \\sqrt{\\frac{9}{25}\\cdot (-1)} \\\\  & =\\pm \\sqrt{\\frac{9}{25}}\\cdot \\sqrt{-1} \\\\  & =\\pm \\frac{\\sqrt{9}}{\\sqrt{25}}\\cdot \\sqrt{-1} \\\\  & =\\pm \\frac{3}{5}\\text{i}\\end{aligned}\n$$"}]}
